WEBVTT

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:34.651
to bring in underrepresented
minorities in science

00:16:34.675 --> 00:16:36.436
to work in our department.

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:40.596
I tried to create
a sense of community among them.

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:45.666
Yesterday, I bought cupcakes
after they had a lunch seminar.

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:48.821
So we had a time together at the kitchen,

00:16:48.845 --> 00:16:50.988
talking about how they're feeling

00:16:51.012 --> 00:16:54.233
and how it's going for them
in the internship program.

00:16:54.257 --> 00:16:59.380
So I try to bring them together
as much as I can.